[[2047,16,65536,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The power socket / cigarette lighter \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P50</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\nsupplied (at pin 2) by the line controlled by the ignition (INT/A)\nfor the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               protected by the fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : both are\nhoused in the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Pin 3 of socket\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P50 is earthed (C20).</strong></p><p>The ring nut for the power socket is lit\nup (at pin 1) when the side lights are on by means of the line coming\nfrom the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               switch and is protected\nby the controls illumination fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The same supply line with the side lights\non also lights up the ashtray light \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>G35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Rear power point\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P52 is supplied (at\npin 2) by ignition-operated line (INT/A) protected by fuse F4 of\nsupplementary fuse box B98 C.</strong></p><p>Pin 3 of socket \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P52  is earthed (C30).</strong></p><p>The ring nut for the rear power point \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P52\n (pin 1) is lit up in the same way as the front power point.</strong></p>"]]